  "pre_gate_answer": "# Briefing: KCERA Audit Services RFP Minimum Qualifications\n\n## Conclusion\nThe provided evidence is **insufficient** to identify the **minimum qualifications** required for an audit firm in the **Kern County Employees' Retirement Association (KCERA)** RFP for audit services.\n\n## Key Findings\n- The evidence does **not include** the KCERA audit services RFP.\n- It does **not provide** a minimum qualifications section for KCERA audit firms.\n- The retrieved materials relate to **other organizations** and **different procurement types**, including:\n  - **OCERS** custody services\n  - **SDCERS** investment consulting\n  - **LACERS** actuarial consulting\n  - **Boston Retirement System** investment consulting\n- Some materials discuss **actuarial** qualifications rather than **audit** firm qualifications.\n\n## Assessment\nBecause the source material is **not specific to KCERA audit services**, any stated minimum qualifications would be **unsupported** by the evidence provided.\n\n## What Is Needed\nTo answer the question accurately, the following is required:\n- The **KCERA RFP for audit services**, or\n- The specific **minimum qualifications** section from that RFP\n\n## Bottom Line\nThe question **cannot be answered reliably** from the provided evidence.",
